WEBVTT

00:19.970 --> 00:23.290
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.530 --> 00:26.770
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.970 --> 00:28.890
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.050 --> 00:32.410
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.610 --> 00:35.930
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.130 --> 00:37.850
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.210 --> 00:41.490
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.770 --> 00:45.010
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.290 --> 00:49.690
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.530 --> 00:55.130
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.970 --> 01:00.850
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.170 --> 01:04.850
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.970 --> 01:09.890
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.130 --> 01:13.370
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.610 --> 01:15.530
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.770 --> 01:17.650
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.090 --> 01:20.010
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.290 --> 01:22.170
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.010 --> 01:29.730
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.730 --> 01:32.370
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.370 --> 01:33.570
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.570 --> 01:34.770
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.770 --> 01:35.970
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.050 --> 01:38.930
[Episode 6]

01:39.300 --> 01:40.560
I paid the right price

01:40.950 --> 01:42.130
for the right thing.

01:42.390 --> 01:43.930
That's what a fair deal should be.

01:44.230 --> 01:44.850
Fine.

01:45.180 --> 01:46.370
Then let me show you

01:46.740 --> 01:48.050
what fairness really means!

01:49.340 --> 01:50.000
Senior Lu,

01:50.820 --> 01:52.570
that fragment of a magic item is dispensable anyway.

01:53.020 --> 01:54.250
The spirit root test is coming up.

01:55.220 --> 01:56.610
Better not stir up trouble.

01:59.150 --> 01:59.730
All right.

02:01.150 --> 02:02.450
Since you spoke up,

02:03.150 --> 02:04.160
I'll back off.

02:05.590 --> 02:06.090
Kid,

02:06.500 --> 02:08.400
you won't be so lucky next time.

02:10.780 --> 02:11.210
Let's go!

02:15.590 --> 02:17.000
These clan disciples

02:17.270 --> 02:18.170
really are arrogant.

02:23.420 --> 02:25.040
Thanks for stepping in just now.

02:25.310 --> 02:26.250
I'm Han Yunzhi.

02:26.780 --> 02:27.720
What's your name?

02:28.140 --> 02:28.610
Han Li.

02:31.380 --> 02:32.040
Li,

02:32.660 --> 02:34.320
are you also here for the spirit root test?

02:37.100 --> 02:38.290
It's about to begin.

02:38.460 --> 02:39.440
Let's go together.

02:40.580 --> 02:41.010
Sure.

03:02.970 --> 03:05.410
[Ye Fei from Yellow Maple Valley]

03:29.750 --> 03:30.840
Fellow cultivators,

03:31.500 --> 03:33.320
this round of the trials is hosted by our Moonshadow Sect,

03:33.340 --> 03:34.560
on behalf of the Seven Sects.

03:35.270 --> 03:36.810
As long as you pass the spirit root test...

03:36.990 --> 03:37.370
Han!

03:37.470 --> 03:38.200
- Over here! - ...you'll have a chance

03:38.270 --> 03:39.370
to be accepted into any sect.

03:40.030 --> 03:40.560
If your talent is exceptional...

03:40.580 --> 03:41.480
I thought you almost missed it.

03:41.500 --> 03:42.760
...you might even receive

03:42.910 --> 03:44.650
invitations from several sects at once.

03:45.140 --> 03:46.400
Then, the candidates get to choose

03:46.550 --> 03:47.490
where they want to go.

03:52.420 --> 03:52.970
Han,

03:53.180 --> 03:53.840
you all right?

03:54.550 --> 03:55.280
Listen.

03:55.510 --> 03:56.440
In the cultivation world,

03:56.580 --> 03:57.400
there's a clear hierarchy.

03:57.620 --> 03:59.250
Low-level cultivators must not look directly at those above them.

03:59.670 --> 04:00.600
That one up there

04:01.020 --> 04:02.600
is a grandmaster at Core Formation Stage.

04:02.950 --> 04:05.250
Never stare at her like that. Got it?

04:07.990 --> 04:09.280
So that's a Core Formation cultivator.

04:10.510 --> 04:11.050
Yeah.

04:13.270 --> 04:14.600
The slots are limited,

04:14.860 --> 04:16.210
so make the most of this chance.

04:56.790 --> 04:57.680
Yan Ruyan.

04:57.900 --> 04:58.650
Wood element.

04:58.700 --> 04:59.440
Heavenly spirit root.

04:59.700 --> 05:00.120
Passed.

05:00.270 --> 05:00.970
Heavenly spirit root!

05:02.110 --> 05:03.400
- She has a heavenly spirit root! - That's amazing!

05:03.510 --> 05:05.250
She's worthy of the heiress of the Yan Clan.

05:05.350 --> 05:06.210
Looks like it won't be long

05:06.420 --> 05:08.400
before Yue Kingdom gains another Core Formation expert!

05:16.350 --> 05:17.600
[Seven Sects' invitations]
All seven sects want her!

05:17.900 --> 05:18.840
She's incredible!

05:22.180 --> 05:23.330
I choose the Moonshadow Sect.

05:29.330 --> 05:30.450
[Moonshadow Sect]

05:36.350 --> 05:37.400
They say the Moonshadow Sect

05:37.420 --> 05:39.160
is the strongest of the Seven Sects currently.

06:07.610 --> 06:09.410
[Treasure Girl]

06:09.740 --> 06:10.770
You blind fool!

06:11.230 --> 06:12.240
How dare you steal from me?

06:16.230 --> 06:17.040
It's just a trial.

06:17.260 --> 06:18.040
Don't let it turn deadly!

06:18.180 --> 06:18.840
Leave it at that.

06:22.820 --> 06:23.920
Fire-wood-element dual spirit root.

06:24.380 --> 06:24.890
Passed.

06:34.750 --> 06:35.790
I choose the Moonshadow Sect!

06:38.820 --> 06:39.280
Later,

06:39.380 --> 06:40.360
I'm going with Moonshadow too.

06:40.710 --> 06:41.660
Which one will you choose, Han?

06:45.590 --> 06:46.630
I'm good with any sect.

07:00.030 --> 07:00.920
I choose Yellow Maple Valley!

07:01.590 --> 07:02.650
I pick Clear Void Sect!

07:03.470 --> 07:04.360
I'm choosing Yellow Maple Valley!

07:05.470 --> 07:06.450
I'm going with Spirit Beast Mountain!

07:07.860 --> 07:09.530
I'm picking Giant Sword Sect!

07:43.230 --> 07:43.840
Brother!

07:44.590 --> 07:45.360
I'm dying...

07:45.550 --> 07:46.400
You okay, brother?

07:46.620 --> 07:47.130
Brother!

07:48.590 --> 07:50.070
Water-fire-earth-element triple spirit root.

07:50.530 --> 07:51.080
Passed.

07:52.380 --> 07:53.160
Put him here.

07:54.060 --> 07:54.920
Be careful.

07:55.740 --> 07:56.160
It's okay.

07:56.470 --> 07:56.970
He's still alive.

08:04.500 --> 08:06.010
You weren't accepted by the Seven Sects.

08:06.350 --> 08:06.920
Rejected.

08:07.230 --> 08:07.920
What?

08:07.920 --> 08:09.240
Why is he rejected?

08:09.390 --> 08:10.600
Why didn't they take me?

08:11.350 --> 08:12.690
What do I lack compared to them?

08:13.380 --> 08:14.360
So this is your so-called fairness,

08:14.620 --> 08:15.770
Seven Sects?

08:18.420 --> 08:19.970
You truly forgot what you did?

08:43.300 --> 08:44.090
I grabbed it!

08:45.150 --> 08:46.890
Metal-water-fire-earth-element quad spirit root.

08:47.180 --> 08:47.690
Rejected.

08:53.380 --> 08:53.840
Han,

08:54.150 --> 08:54.690
it's all up to you now!

09:07.670 --> 09:08.210
Kid,

09:08.420 --> 09:09.530
it's not your turn yet.

09:10.420 --> 09:11.240
He's way too cocky.

09:12.060 --> 09:14.530
Looks like your spirit root must be trash.

09:15.150 --> 09:16.280
That guy holds a grudge.

09:16.940 --> 09:18.690
How can trash like him exist in the cultivation world?

09:19.910 --> 09:21.090
Wind-element variant spirit root.

09:21.470 --> 09:22.160
Passed.

09:27.110 --> 09:28.280
I choose Yellow Maple Valley!

09:30.550 --> 09:31.480
How boring.

09:32.180 --> 09:34.010
That was too easy!

09:34.790 --> 09:35.280
Qiaoqian.

09:40.110 --> 09:41.570
Water-earth-element dual spirit root.

09:41.940 --> 09:42.530
Passed.

09:43.300 --> 09:44.280
Another one made it.

09:52.860 --> 09:53.770
I pick Yellow Maple Valley.

10:00.230 --> 10:01.280
Now give him the orb.

10:29.900 --> 10:31.640
Wood-water-fire-earth-element quad spirit root.

10:32.430 --> 10:32.970
Rejected.

10:35.590 --> 10:37.690
Rogue cultivators always get rejected.

10:38.110 --> 10:40.880
With a fake spirit root, yet dare show up here?

10:41.230 --> 10:43.290
How shameless!

10:43.380 --> 10:44.360
Totally shameless!

10:45.660 --> 10:47.330
Embarrassing!

11:09.310 --> 11:10.570
Wood-earth-element dual spirit root.

11:10.860 --> 11:11.450
Passed.

11:14.310 --> 11:14.840
Han.

11:14.840 --> 11:15.850
We're up next!

11:21.660 --> 11:22.600
I choose Spirit Beast Mountain!

11:39.950 --> 11:41.250
This is the final cultivator

11:41.250 --> 11:42.690
to pass the test today.

11:56.190 --> 11:57.050
Didn't expect it.

11:57.190 --> 11:58.760
We're both outcasts now.

12:02.630 --> 12:03.890
No need to feel down, everyone.

12:04.340 --> 12:06.040
There's still the tournament at Tianwu Arena!

12:06.220 --> 12:06.920
The tournament?

12:07.340 --> 12:08.610
Will that even help?

12:08.910 --> 12:10.280
Even if we fight,

12:11.340 --> 12:12.440
as rogue cultivators,

12:12.670 --> 12:13.560
going up against those clan kids

12:13.580 --> 12:15.650
raised on elixirs since birth,

12:15.910 --> 12:16.850
what chance do we have?

12:17.460 --> 12:18.530
Are we rogue cultivators

12:18.550 --> 12:20.880
doomed to always be trampled by them?

12:20.940 --> 12:21.850
I can't just swallow this!

12:21.870 --> 12:23.650
They keep talking about the same stuff.

12:24.150 --> 12:24.730
Still,

12:25.180 --> 12:26.440
there might be another way.

12:27.340 --> 12:28.560
I happen to have a clever plan.

12:28.870 --> 12:29.850
But...

12:30.180 --> 12:31.650
I'll need everyone's help.

12:31.990 --> 12:33.160
What plan, Sir?

12:33.340 --> 12:34.970
We can't wait. Just spit it out!

12:35.030 --> 12:35.730
Sir, please tell us!

12:35.750 --> 12:36.970
No more teasing.

12:38.100 --> 12:38.850
Mr. Wan,

12:39.550 --> 12:41.200
if we run into each other on the arena,

12:41.750 --> 12:42.680
how do you think you'd fare?

12:45.510 --> 12:47.130
Sir, you're really joking.

12:47.390 --> 12:48.610
Your cultivation is way above mine.

12:48.630 --> 12:49.800
Of course I'd lose.

12:51.510 --> 12:52.320
Then...

12:54.220 --> 12:55.280
what if I lend you

12:55.420 --> 12:56.130
this horsetail whisk?

12:56.550 --> 12:57.890
It's a mid-grade artifact.

12:58.670 --> 12:59.850
Well...

13:00.300 --> 13:01.160
I might have a fifty-fifty chance.

13:03.270 --> 13:04.440
What if I also lend you

13:04.580 --> 13:05.610
this treasure?

13:07.060 --> 13:08.080
Then...

13:08.180 --> 13:09.040
maybe...

13:09.300 --> 13:09.680
Oh,

13:09.820 --> 13:11.010
I'd have a seventy percent chance!

13:11.820 --> 13:12.370
Great.

13:13.180 --> 13:14.250
In the cultivation world,

13:14.940 --> 13:16.280
battles aren't just about power.

13:16.550 --> 13:17.770
They also rely on artifacts,

13:18.060 --> 13:18.680
talismans,

13:19.150 --> 13:19.800
and pills.

13:20.820 --> 13:22.010
In terms of strength and techniques,

13:22.030 --> 13:23.130
we can't compete

13:23.150 --> 13:24.160
with those arrogant clan disciples.

13:24.580 --> 13:25.650
But there's one thing we have

13:25.670 --> 13:26.920
that they don't,

13:27.630 --> 13:28.560
unity.

13:29.460 --> 13:31.250
If our Azure Vein Society had a hundred rogue cultivators,

13:31.580 --> 13:32.250
and each one

13:32.420 --> 13:34.010
was willing to contribute a treasure,

13:34.700 --> 13:35.370
then we'd have

13:35.910 --> 13:37.280
a hundred treasures in our hands!

13:37.790 --> 13:39.040
With that many treasures,

13:39.510 --> 13:40.770
even if we're facing

13:41.100 --> 13:42.250
Foundation Establishment cultivators,

13:42.460 --> 13:43.080
we might

13:43.180 --> 13:44.040
still stand a chance.

13:44.700 --> 13:45.680
Absolutely!

13:47.060 --> 13:48.890
I'm willing to lend my mid-grade whisk

13:49.580 --> 13:50.610
for everyone to use.

13:51.100 --> 13:51.970
Qingwen...

13:52.750 --> 13:54.030
Since I brought this up,

13:54.030 --> 13:54.970
it's only right I set the example.

13:55.270 --> 13:56.250
I've said before.

13:56.550 --> 13:57.800
The reason I founded the Azure Vein Society

13:57.940 --> 13:59.080
was to build a world

13:59.100 --> 14:00.200
where all cultivators are equal.

14:00.910 --> 14:02.250
We'll show those clan kids

14:02.790 --> 14:03.610
that rogue cultivators like us

14:03.790 --> 14:04.970
are no less than any of them!

14:05.180 --> 14:05.610
Yes!

14:05.630 --> 14:06.250
- Yes! - Right!

14:06.270 --> 14:06.920
We're not weaker than them!

14:06.990 --> 14:07.650
They're nothing special!

14:07.990 --> 14:08.800
See?

14:09.060 --> 14:10.250
You can't go wrong following this sir!

14:10.420 --> 14:11.010
I know,

14:11.150 --> 14:12.440
even with all these treasures,

14:12.700 --> 14:13.530
not everyone here

14:13.700 --> 14:15.560
will walk away victorious.

14:16.390 --> 14:17.850
But as long as we give it our all,

14:18.180 --> 14:19.040
even if we lose,

14:19.340 --> 14:21.010
we'll make those clan disciples see

14:21.390 --> 14:22.220
we rogue cultivators

14:22.270 --> 14:23.240
won't be pushed around!

14:23.510 --> 14:25.020
We won't be pushed around!

14:25.150 --> 14:26.080
We won't be pushed around!

14:26.340 --> 14:26.730
Sir,

14:27.050 --> 14:28.200
even though I lack talent,

14:28.420 --> 14:28.970
I still want

14:29.150 --> 14:29.800
to contribute something!

14:30.180 --> 14:30.610
Good!

14:31.670 --> 14:32.200
Then,

14:32.510 --> 14:33.530
those who want to help,

14:33.670 --> 14:34.320
come with me!

14:34.550 --> 14:35.280
All right!

14:35.580 --> 14:36.040
Let's go!

14:36.150 --> 14:36.680
Yes!

14:37.030 --> 14:37.610
I'll contribute what I can!

14:39.100 --> 14:39.680
Take mine!

14:39.960 --> 14:40.880
- Take mine! - Here you go!

14:41.340 --> 14:41.730
Take mine!

14:41.820 --> 14:43.530
So that's their plan all along.

14:51.220 --> 14:51.850
Mr. Han,

14:52.340 --> 14:53.370
would you be willing to help?

14:57.220 --> 14:58.560
After hearing what you said,

14:58.910 --> 15:00.280
I've lost interest

15:00.580 --> 15:01.890
in joining the Seven Sects.

15:02.910 --> 15:04.130
I won't join the tournament

15:05.150 --> 15:06.040
at Tianwu Arena.

15:08.100 --> 15:08.850
My friend,

15:09.030 --> 15:10.160
this is our best chance

15:10.180 --> 15:11.530
to make a name for ourselves!

15:11.550 --> 15:12.160
Yeah, a golden opportunity!

15:12.180 --> 15:12.800
- Right! - Totally!

15:13.510 --> 15:14.340
Do your part!

15:14.340 --> 15:15.490
Looks like I can't leave today

15:16.100 --> 15:17.320
without bleeding a little.

15:17.510 --> 15:18.280
If you've got treasures,

15:18.340 --> 15:19.490
bring them out and share!

15:21.300 --> 15:21.850
All right.

15:24.150 --> 15:25.040
I happened

15:25.670 --> 15:26.440
to come across

15:26.580 --> 15:27.920
a restorative pill.

15:28.670 --> 15:29.730
I planned to keep it for myself.

15:30.460 --> 15:31.200
But under the circumstances,

15:32.820 --> 15:33.970
I'll share it with everyone.

15:34.300 --> 15:36.250
Much appreciated, Mr.!

15:37.270 --> 15:38.560
That's a good one.

15:40.300 --> 15:41.370
Ugh, my stomach hurts.

15:42.910 --> 15:43.890
I need to take a quick break.

15:44.460 --> 15:45.370
You guys keep chatting.

15:56.340 --> 15:56.920
Han!

16:02.220 --> 16:02.890
You...

16:03.390 --> 16:04.280
You're fine?

16:06.940 --> 16:07.560
I'm fine now.

16:12.030 --> 16:12.680
Xiaoshan,

16:13.630 --> 16:14.650
Are you here to talk me

16:14.790 --> 16:15.920
into joining the Azure Vein Society?

16:16.270 --> 16:17.280
Of course not.

16:17.820 --> 16:18.320
But,

16:18.340 --> 16:19.130
aren't you planning to join

16:19.150 --> 16:20.370
the Tianwu Arena tournament

16:20.390 --> 16:21.530
and win yourself a Foundation Pill?

16:23.220 --> 16:24.280
The Seven Sects are great,

16:24.940 --> 16:26.280
but I gotta stay alive first.

16:27.180 --> 16:28.200
I knew it, Han.

16:28.220 --> 16:29.280
You're not one to go in blind.

16:32.340 --> 16:32.730
Well,

16:33.550 --> 16:35.130
you weren't joining the fight.

16:35.630 --> 16:36.560
So why'd you still

16:36.700 --> 16:37.730
share your treasure?

16:38.260 --> 16:40.080
Just trying to win us rogues a little respect.

16:40.340 --> 16:41.160
Xiaoshan.

16:43.420 --> 16:44.730
I can't shake the feeling that those guys

16:45.030 --> 16:46.080
aren't as simple as they look.

16:46.990 --> 16:48.200
With your kind of naivety,

16:48.670 --> 16:49.650
you'll get burned.

16:50.100 --> 16:50.850
No way!

16:51.030 --> 16:52.400
All rogue cultivators are one big family!

16:52.580 --> 16:53.530
You're overthinking it, Han.

16:57.870 --> 16:59.010
With what we saved up earlier,

16:59.180 --> 17:00.770
we've got thirty-eight artifacts now.

17:01.150 --> 17:01.680
Qingwen,

17:02.180 --> 17:03.610
why not take all this

17:03.790 --> 17:05.440
and run off now?

17:05.670 --> 17:06.160
No can do.

17:06.550 --> 17:07.370
The barrier at the Tainan Bazaar

17:07.390 --> 17:08.970
won't lift until the tournament is over.

17:09.580 --> 17:10.890
We can't leave yet.

17:13.220 --> 17:14.200
If those rogue cultivators

17:14.550 --> 17:15.560
give up their treasures willingly,

17:15.750 --> 17:16.370
that's ideal.

17:17.180 --> 17:18.560
If not...

17:19.820 --> 17:20.650
Don't worry, Sir!

17:20.790 --> 17:21.850
If they won't,

17:22.030 --> 17:22.770
I'll be the first to...

17:23.060 --> 17:23.440
Yeah,

17:23.460 --> 17:24.200
we won't spare them!

17:27.750 --> 17:28.890
How many times do I have to say it?

17:29.100 --> 17:30.250
Stop talking about fighting and killing

17:30.290 --> 17:31.160
all the time!

17:35.300 --> 17:35.800
Get up.

17:39.510 --> 17:40.280
Yes, Sir.

17:40.820 --> 17:41.610
Step back.

17:51.100 --> 17:51.800
Li!

17:56.870 --> 17:58.040
I finally found you!

17:58.700 --> 17:59.650
What is it now?

17:59.870 --> 18:01.530
I've got more talismans here.

18:02.030 --> 18:03.320
I want to trade for more pills.

18:03.750 --> 18:04.320
Would that be okay?

18:10.030 --> 18:11.440
I've got Strength Boost Talismans,

18:11.460 --> 18:12.200
and Freezing Talismans.

18:12.550 --> 18:14.080
These are offensive.

18:14.340 --> 18:15.850
These ones are defensive.

18:16.510 --> 18:17.920
This Vajra Talisman is amazing!

18:18.420 --> 18:19.130
It can block

18:19.150 --> 18:21.370
a full-force strike from a tenth-level Qi Refiner!

18:22.270 --> 18:22.850
What about this one?

18:23.300 --> 18:24.800
This is a Thunderfire Talisman.

18:25.100 --> 18:27.370
It hits with both lightning and fire at once.

18:28.030 --> 18:28.560
Look!

18:32.790 --> 18:33.730
Maybe...

18:34.180 --> 18:35.770
I'll get you two brand new ones.

18:37.510 --> 18:38.400
That's weird.

18:38.630 --> 18:40.450
I followed the book's instructions exactly.

18:42.340 --> 18:42.930
Li,

18:43.270 --> 18:43.880
how about

18:44.030 --> 18:45.080
these two?

18:45.710 --> 18:46.320
I guarantee

18:46.430 --> 18:47.490
they're top quality.

18:48.510 --> 18:49.730
These two...

18:51.100 --> 18:51.730
Miss Han,

18:52.430 --> 18:53.640
why do you need pills so urgently?

18:55.230 --> 18:56.640
I want to cure my brother's illness.

18:59.820 --> 19:00.600
Sorry,

19:01.270 --> 19:02.360
but your talismans

19:02.660 --> 19:03.320
are not very useful

19:03.470 --> 19:04.280
to me.

19:05.750 --> 19:06.560
Still,

19:07.660 --> 19:08.450
if you've got

19:08.510 --> 19:10.560
cinnabar and talisman paper,

19:10.900 --> 19:11.930
I might be interested.

19:13.340 --> 19:14.360
You want to make talismans yourself?

19:16.900 --> 19:17.490
Then you'll

19:17.580 --> 19:18.450
definitely need this!

19:22.340 --> 19:22.970
This one

19:23.030 --> 19:24.080
is a Golden Bamboo Brush.

19:24.820 --> 19:25.530
The tip

19:25.790 --> 19:27.320
is made from the tail hair of a Level 2 demon beast.

19:27.900 --> 19:28.490
The shaft

19:28.620 --> 19:30.770
is forged from black iron mixed with refined gold.

19:31.430 --> 19:32.640
It was crafted using secret techniques

19:32.900 --> 19:34.770
by a Foundation Establishment cultivator.

19:35.510 --> 19:37.640
This is a must-have tool for talisman making!

19:49.620 --> 19:50.560
A true rarity!

19:51.380 --> 19:52.360
You're really selling it to me?

19:53.060 --> 19:54.010
Honestly...

19:54.470 --> 19:55.930
it's a family heirloom.

19:56.820 --> 19:58.040
But as you can see,

19:58.340 --> 19:59.730
I'm terrible

19:59.860 --> 20:01.360
at making talismans.

20:01.710 --> 20:03.080
So this brush

20:03.190 --> 20:04.170
is pretty much wasted

20:04.270 --> 20:05.120
on me.

20:06.550 --> 20:07.170
How much are you asking?

20:08.860 --> 20:09.970
Two bottles of pills.

20:10.270 --> 20:10.880
How about that?

20:12.270 --> 20:13.450
I'll even throw in

20:13.470 --> 20:14.320
these talismans, ink,

20:14.430 --> 20:15.560
and this Talisman Compendium.

20:15.560 --> 20:19.170
[Talisman Compendium]

20:22.100 --> 20:22.560
Deal.

20:32.860 --> 20:33.530
Li!

20:36.380 --> 20:38.210
I also have a Clear Stream Note.

20:38.270 --> 20:39.170
It's got all sorts of funny stories

20:39.190 --> 20:40.490
from the cultivation world.

20:40.620 --> 20:41.360
I've read it already.

20:41.620 --> 20:42.800
If you get bored,

20:42.900 --> 20:43.800
maybe it'll help pass the time.

20:50.010 --> 20:50.970
[Clear Stream Note]

20:53.340 --> 20:54.360
I was hoping to learn more anyway.

20:55.140 --> 20:55.600
Thanks.

21:12.260 --> 21:13.800
"Anyone holding an Ascension Token

21:14.260 --> 21:15.690
can skip testing and join a sect,

21:16.340 --> 21:18.210
and even get a Foundation Pill."

21:19.150 --> 21:20.520
What's an Ascension Token?

21:30.410 --> 21:32.370
[Token]

22:05.100 --> 22:05.600
Han!

22:06.620 --> 22:07.690
Let's go check out the Tianwu Arena!

22:08.750 --> 22:09.560
I heard

22:09.670 --> 22:10.800
the sects have prepared

22:10.820 --> 22:12.280
a bunch of rewards this time

22:12.430 --> 22:14.600
to attract more participants.

22:14.860 --> 22:16.730
The winner gets a Foundation Pill

22:16.910 --> 22:19.280
and a ton of gems and techniques.

22:21.580 --> 22:22.280
Xiaoshan,

22:23.430 --> 22:24.560
I got a book

22:24.820 --> 22:26.690
with all sorts of cultivation oddities.

22:27.230 --> 22:28.130
Not sure if they're true.

22:28.580 --> 22:29.650
Want to check it out together?

22:29.950 --> 22:30.410
Sure!

22:33.190 --> 22:33.560
Come over.

22:42.230 --> 22:43.840
Clear Stream Note?

22:52.670 --> 22:53.320
What's this?

22:54.710 --> 22:55.450
Looks like

22:56.060 --> 22:58.490
a token from some sect.

23:00.670 --> 23:01.840
That's not just any token.

23:03.100 --> 23:04.450
Look at the writing on it.

23:08.260 --> 23:09.930
Ascension Token...

23:11.390 --> 23:12.690
Ascension Token?

23:12.860 --> 23:13.800
What's that?

23:17.390 --> 23:18.310
The Ascension Token

23:18.310 --> 23:20.040
is for...

23:20.300 --> 23:21.520
They say...

23:23.190 --> 23:24.080
Well, I heard,

23:25.060 --> 23:26.280
if you hold

23:26.670 --> 23:28.150
an Ascension Token,

23:28.390 --> 23:29.210
you don't have to fight,

23:29.510 --> 23:30.480
don't have to take the spirit root test,

23:31.100 --> 23:32.450
you get straight into any of the Seven Sects.

23:33.300 --> 23:34.040
Is that true?

23:34.820 --> 23:36.080
Nonsense!

23:36.510 --> 23:37.450
If that were true,

23:37.580 --> 23:39.320
everyone would be fighting over this token.

23:39.580 --> 23:41.080
Who'd bother risking their lives at the tournament?

23:42.950 --> 23:43.490
Exactly.

23:44.100 --> 23:45.080
Sounds like a made-up story.

23:52.260 --> 23:52.930
Grandmaster,

23:53.150 --> 23:54.040
you were right.

23:54.260 --> 23:55.930
Several clan disciples

23:56.020 --> 23:57.560
have reported their tokens stolen.

23:59.990 --> 24:02.210
The Azure Vein Society never quit causing trouble,

24:02.750 --> 24:04.410
even hit during the entrance test.

24:05.190 --> 24:06.690
What should we do now?

24:09.230 --> 24:10.730
So those rogue cultivators' missing

24:10.860 --> 24:12.170
is really linked to them.

24:12.510 --> 24:14.000
And now they're pinning it on the clan disciples.

24:15.100 --> 24:16.490
Once the Tianwu Arena tournament ends,

24:17.510 --> 24:18.490
let's arrest them all.

24:20.540 --> 24:21.210
Yes, Grandmaster.

24:44.580 --> 24:45.210
Looks like

24:45.620 --> 24:46.600
this Ascension Token

24:47.020 --> 24:48.000
is tied to Yellow Maple Valley.

24:48.990 --> 24:49.930
Yellow Maple Valley...

24:50.670 --> 24:51.650
They say it's one of the top sects

24:51.950 --> 24:53.450
among the Seven.

24:54.100 --> 24:55.210
What luck!

25:23.150 --> 25:24.320
Nothing left to worry about now.

25:52.300 --> 25:54.000
Charging in knowing you'll lose?

25:54.340 --> 25:56.170
You think you're worthy of this Foundation Pill?

25:56.750 --> 25:57.760
I've waited for this day

25:57.910 --> 25:59.040
for decades.

25:59.620 --> 26:00.800
You clan kid,

26:01.470 --> 26:02.210
don't get cocky!

26:19.710 --> 26:21.080
Who is this Qingwen?

26:21.340 --> 26:22.520
Why does he have so many treasures?

26:24.060 --> 26:24.650
Is Lu

26:24.750 --> 26:25.730
about to lose?

26:26.780 --> 26:27.320
No way.

26:27.710 --> 26:28.490
He's just about to win.

26:57.470 --> 26:58.000
Sir,

26:58.540 --> 26:59.130
you went easy on me.

27:14.190 --> 27:14.970
It's a test.

27:15.150 --> 27:16.170
Don't take it too far.

27:16.710 --> 27:17.600
He already admitted defeat.

27:17.860 --> 27:18.890
Why try to kill him?

27:20.430 --> 27:20.890
Grandmaster,

27:20.990 --> 27:21.650
please forgive me.

27:22.470 --> 27:23.130
I didn't realize

27:23.580 --> 27:25.690
he had already surrendered.

27:26.430 --> 27:27.690
You didn't realize

27:27.990 --> 27:29.080
or was it because your opponent

27:29.100 --> 27:30.690
was just some nameless rogue cultivator

27:30.950 --> 27:31.970
and you didn't care?

27:34.710 --> 27:35.650
Thank you, Grandmaster,

27:35.860 --> 27:36.890
for standing up

27:37.150 --> 27:38.000
for us rogue cultivators!

27:38.150 --> 27:38.650
Yes!

27:38.820 --> 27:39.600
Thank you for standing up for us!

27:39.950 --> 27:41.000
Please stand up for us!

27:41.950 --> 27:43.520
Please, we need your voice!

27:45.430 --> 27:47.690
I'm aware many rogue cultivators have gone missing lately.

27:48.190 --> 27:49.210
Our Moonshadow Sect

27:49.300 --> 27:50.450
will get to the bottom of it.

27:51.060 --> 27:52.370
If anyone is found stirring up conflict

27:52.390 --> 27:53.970
between rogues and clan disciples,

27:54.100 --> 27:55.370
disrupting the order of the cultivation world,

27:58.150 --> 27:59.650
I will not show mercy.

28:14.860 --> 28:15.840
Lu Mingyuan

28:16.020 --> 28:16.560
wins!

28:16.820 --> 28:18.240
Receives one Foundation Pill!

28:18.260 --> 28:19.370
Senior Lu is amazing!

28:19.390 --> 28:20.650
You've got the Foundation Pill!

28:25.540 --> 28:26.560
A cultivator's strength

28:27.020 --> 28:28.040
doesn't just depend on spirit roots,

28:28.990 --> 28:29.840
but also on artifacts,

28:30.260 --> 28:30.970
talismans,

28:31.300 --> 28:32.000
formations,

28:32.260 --> 28:32.800
and pills.

28:33.820 --> 28:35.210
Use everything you've got,

28:35.510 --> 28:36.520
plan carefully before making a move.

28:36.780 --> 28:37.760
Lay low, then explode.

28:38.670 --> 28:39.410
Maybe...

28:40.190 --> 28:41.760
this is the path meant for me.

28:42.950 --> 28:44.650
But in the face of overwhelming strength,

28:45.150 --> 28:46.800
all shortcuts

28:47.060 --> 28:48.210
are doomed to fail.

28:48.230 --> 28:50.240
- Congrats, Senior Lu! - Congrats, Senior Lu!

28:55.060 --> 28:57.130
He got into Yellow Maple Valley too?

28:57.950 --> 28:59.520
What are the odds!

29:08.540 --> 29:09.760
Just one step...

29:10.820 --> 29:11.930
I was just one step from victory!

29:12.620 --> 29:13.210
Qingwen,

29:13.710 --> 29:14.450
that guy's a genius

29:14.820 --> 29:16.210
with a variant spirit root after all.

29:16.580 --> 29:17.760
No need to go head-to-head with him.

29:18.860 --> 29:19.760
We failed this time,

29:20.020 --> 29:21.080
but there's always next time.

29:21.230 --> 29:21.970
Next time?

29:22.670 --> 29:23.690
You think chances like this come easy?

29:24.230 --> 29:25.490
I told you,

29:25.710 --> 29:27.170
we rogue cultivators are one big family.

29:27.470 --> 29:28.280
Don't take it so hard.

29:28.300 --> 29:28.800
Enough already.

29:28.860 --> 29:29.930
You're making my heart ache.

29:30.230 --> 29:30.650
Hey...

29:37.950 --> 29:38.800
Listen, everyone.

29:39.190 --> 29:40.280
Don't be so down.

29:40.580 --> 29:41.690
I heard

29:41.950 --> 29:43.600
if you find a certain item,

29:43.910 --> 29:45.520
you can skip the tournament

29:45.710 --> 29:47.280
and still get into the Seven Sects.

29:47.580 --> 29:48.890
- What item? - What is it?

29:50.910 --> 29:52.210
I think it's called...

29:53.390 --> 29:53.930
the Ascension Token!

29:54.230 --> 29:55.760
Ascension Token?

29:56.260 --> 29:57.170
Ascension Token?

29:58.430 --> 29:59.240
Sir,

29:59.820 --> 30:00.690
I was about to ask you.

30:00.910 --> 30:02.080
Do you know about the Ascension Token?

30:02.230 --> 30:02.930
The Ascension Token

30:03.020 --> 30:04.240
was created by the Seven Sects.

30:04.470 --> 30:05.560
It was meant to reward

30:05.820 --> 30:07.370
cultivation families who made great contributions.

30:08.190 --> 30:09.240
It could be passed down for generations.

30:09.820 --> 30:10.450
They say

30:10.580 --> 30:11.370
anyone who holds one

30:11.620 --> 30:12.730
can join any sect

30:13.100 --> 30:13.840
without taking the test

30:14.390 --> 30:15.730
and even get a Foundation Pill.

30:16.910 --> 30:17.970
A Foundation Pill?

30:19.230 --> 30:21.890
No test and a Foundation Pill?

30:22.100 --> 30:23.450
That's amazing.

30:24.710 --> 30:25.520
But this thing

30:25.860 --> 30:27.690
hasn't shown up for centuries.

30:28.670 --> 30:29.650
How do you even know about it?

30:31.300 --> 30:32.040
I didn't know,

30:32.260 --> 30:33.040
but Han...

30:33.910 --> 30:35.450
He read about it in a book.

30:37.150 --> 30:38.280
He asked you directly?

30:40.540 --> 30:41.930
No...

30:42.510 --> 30:43.320
Not really.

30:43.540 --> 30:45.690
We were just casually chatting.

30:45.950 --> 30:46.600
Where's Han Li now?

30:47.260 --> 30:48.170
Why isn't he here?

30:48.470 --> 30:49.130
Han Li...

30:51.230 --> 30:52.560
He's not around.

30:54.390 --> 30:55.000
Weren't you

30:55.340 --> 30:56.560
always with him?

30:58.190 --> 30:59.690
I don't really know him that well.

31:00.150 --> 31:01.080
I think he already left.

31:01.820 --> 31:02.650
He left?

31:03.990 --> 31:05.240
But the barrier's still active.

31:06.020 --> 31:06.520
Where could he go?

31:07.710 --> 31:08.320
He...

31:08.910 --> 31:09.320
I...

31:16.150 --> 31:16.840
My stomach hurts!

31:16.990 --> 31:18.280
I need a bathroom break!

31:21.260 --> 31:22.410
Why'd he run off?

31:23.100 --> 31:24.080
Is it really stomach pain?

31:24.260 --> 31:25.450
You buying it?

31:30.060 --> 31:30.650
Looks like

31:31.150 --> 31:32.840
this trip to the Tainan Bazaar wasn't for nothing.

31:33.780 --> 31:35.930
These treasures will really help my cultivation later on.

31:45.540 --> 31:46.890
So what if I have a fake spirit root?

31:47.470 --> 31:48.240
With this Ascension Token,

31:48.620 --> 31:49.320
I've got nothing to worry about!

32:14.390 --> 32:15.490
I'll just stay hidden till morning.

32:15.990 --> 32:17.040
Once the barrier lifts,

32:17.260 --> 32:18.130
I'll head straight

32:18.860 --> 32:19.890
to Yellow Maple Valley.

32:24.260 --> 32:24.760
He's there!

32:25.950 --> 32:26.370
Hurry!

32:28.150 --> 32:28.650
Stop!

32:30.260 --> 32:30.800
Stop running!

32:32.020 --> 32:32.450
Get him!

32:32.710 --> 32:33.210
Stop!

32:38.470 --> 32:38.970
Stop!

32:39.710 --> 32:40.210
He's there!

32:40.620 --> 32:41.080
Quick!

33:07.290 --> 33:07.880
Han!

33:08.220 --> 33:08.860
Han!

33:16.540 --> 33:17.370
Han!

33:17.620 --> 33:18.400
Han!

33:18.820 --> 33:19.490
Han!

33:21.060 --> 33:21.760
Xiaoshan!

33:51.990 --> 33:52.520
Xiaoshan!

33:52.990 --> 33:53.650
What happened?

33:54.510 --> 33:55.040
Han...

33:55.710 --> 33:56.560
Run!

33:57.300 --> 33:59.280
Qingwen and his men are bad guys...

34:00.750 --> 34:01.410
I'm sorry...

34:02.820 --> 34:03.320
I...

34:03.780 --> 34:04.370
I got you

34:04.750 --> 34:06.130
into trouble...

34:16.230 --> 34:17.210
The Ascension Token

34:17.820 --> 34:18.620
has been exposed.

34:29.100 --> 34:29.890
Han!

34:30.260 --> 34:31.210
Why are you running?

34:31.540 --> 34:32.800
Stay and have a drink with us!

35:11.510 --> 35:12.280
Nowhere to run now, huh?

35:18.750 --> 35:19.320
You two,

35:20.150 --> 35:21.040
why are you after me?

35:21.340 --> 35:22.370
What do you think?

35:22.910 --> 35:24.170
At this point,

35:24.580 --> 35:25.280
Han,

35:25.950 --> 35:27.240
you can drop the act.

35:29.100 --> 35:30.040
Han,

35:30.540 --> 35:32.040
you're being awfully selfish.

35:32.580 --> 35:34.450
You got a treasure like the Ascension Token,

35:34.860 --> 35:35.840
but won't even

35:35.990 --> 35:37.240
let us take a look?

35:38.300 --> 35:39.130
Ascension Token?

35:39.750 --> 35:40.690
What is that?

35:41.060 --> 35:41.930
Never heard of it!

35:43.060 --> 35:43.810
In broad daylight,

35:44.390 --> 35:46.000
you're trying to rob and kill someone.

35:46.660 --> 35:48.250
Aren't you afraid the Seven Sects' punishment?

35:50.100 --> 35:51.080
Enough talk.

35:51.740 --> 35:52.810
Take him down first,

35:53.700 --> 35:54.770
then search his body.

36:35.700 --> 36:36.560
Where did he go?

36:37.620 --> 36:38.200
Find him!

36:39.700 --> 36:40.930
This won't work if it keeps up.

36:41.660 --> 36:42.410
That Qingwen guy

36:42.830 --> 36:43.930
is still hiding in the shadows.

36:47.910 --> 36:48.770
Han,

36:50.990 --> 36:52.200
I see you!

36:58.580 --> 36:59.600
Stop hiding!

37:00.310 --> 37:01.250
Come out!

37:11.580 --> 37:12.720
A high-grade artifact!

37:15.100 --> 37:16.040
Qingwen!

37:16.270 --> 37:17.250
Help me!

37:18.390 --> 37:19.290
Qingwen!

37:41.990 --> 37:43.000
I knew you'd show up!

37:44.740 --> 37:45.560
Wan Xiaoshan

37:46.270 --> 37:47.250
was killed by you?

37:47.830 --> 37:49.290
He was a good man.

37:49.990 --> 37:50.770
But good men...

37:51.270 --> 37:52.200
die too.

37:52.990 --> 37:54.040
You lost your men too.

37:54.830 --> 37:55.810
Why didn't you save them?

37:56.620 --> 37:58.770
I had a feeling you had something up your sleeve.

37:59.430 --> 38:00.600
So I let them go first.

38:01.470 --> 38:02.520
Looks like I was right.

38:05.390 --> 38:06.410
I get it now.

38:07.270 --> 38:08.160
There are three of you,

38:08.830 --> 38:09.720
but only one

38:10.270 --> 38:11.000
Ascension Token.

38:14.350 --> 38:15.560
You're a clever guy.

38:16.020 --> 38:17.000
Pinggu and I go way back.

38:17.430 --> 38:18.850
If this weren't about the path to ascension,

38:19.660 --> 38:20.930
I wouldn't have let her die.

38:24.100 --> 38:26.370
You really are a complete villain.

38:29.990 --> 38:30.970
Han...

38:32.100 --> 38:33.040
that Flying Sword Talisman

38:33.620 --> 38:35.120
is your last trick, right?

38:37.430 --> 38:37.930
What do you think?

39:03.390 --> 39:04.560
This is Tainan Valley!

39:05.100 --> 39:06.000
If you kill me here,

39:06.350 --> 39:07.410
aren't you afraid you'll get caught?

39:07.910 --> 39:08.770
You showed up out of nowhere,

39:08.830 --> 39:09.520
clearly up to no good.

39:10.060 --> 39:11.290
All I have to say is you snuck in here,

39:11.700 --> 39:12.810
killed Wan Xiaoshan,

39:12.950 --> 39:13.560
Wu Jiuzhi,

39:13.660 --> 39:14.330
and Pinggu.

39:14.700 --> 39:16.290
I'll kill you to avenge them.

39:16.470 --> 39:17.450
Do you think the other rogues

39:17.540 --> 39:18.200
will believe you,

39:18.310 --> 39:19.270
or believe me?

39:20.700 --> 39:21.200
Fine!

39:22.060 --> 39:22.720
Then,

39:22.950 --> 39:24.370
I'll use the token as bait.

39:25.180 --> 39:26.250
Whoever kills you,

39:26.830 --> 39:27.600
gets it!

39:27.990 --> 39:28.490
You!

40:23.700 --> 40:24.560
You'd throw your life away

40:25.140 --> 40:26.080
over a token?

40:27.140 --> 40:28.080
You're still young.

40:29.060 --> 40:30.080
You don't understand what this means

40:30.620 --> 40:31.930
to us rogue cultivators...

40:44.370 --> 40:46.100
[Ice Demoness]

40:46.100 --> 40:46.600
Who's there?

40:58.910 --> 41:00.450
So, you're Daoist Qingwen?

41:03.510 --> 41:05.160
Looks like you're dying.

41:05.430 --> 41:06.720
But my master said

41:06.950 --> 41:08.160
you can't die just yet.

41:10.020 --> 41:11.160
Which means...

41:11.830 --> 41:13.450
he'll have to die instead.

41:22.310 --> 41:23.370
What stage is that guy in?

41:23.470 --> 41:24.810
I can't even track his movements.

41:25.020 --> 41:25.910
If I get caught,

41:25.910 --> 41:26.720
I'm dead for sure.

41:26.950 --> 41:27.520
I have to run!

41:44.740 --> 41:45.720
Who are you, sir?

41:47.990 --> 41:50.120
You founded the Azure Vein Society?

41:52.020 --> 41:53.560
Interesting...

41:53.990 --> 41:55.200
I'm just trying to stay alive.

41:55.540 --> 41:56.370
That guy earlier

41:56.510 --> 41:57.520
had the real treasure.

41:58.180 --> 41:59.560
If you can spare me,

41:59.790 --> 42:01.000
I'll question him myself

42:01.310 --> 42:02.450
and hand over the treasure!

42:03.740 --> 42:04.970
Ascension Token?

42:07.140 --> 42:09.410
A crumb tossed by the Seven Sects.

42:09.580 --> 42:11.250
You call that a treasure?

42:13.830 --> 42:14.770
Are you interested...

42:16.470 --> 42:19.160
in becoming a Foundation Establishment cultivator?

42:19.870 --> 42:20.720
Foundation...

42:23.910 --> 42:24.640
Senior,

42:24.870 --> 42:25.970
if you can help me

42:26.350 --> 42:27.490
step into the Foundation Establishment stage,

42:27.740 --> 42:28.890
I, Qingwen, will give my life

42:29.310 --> 42:30.290
to repay you!

42:32.990 --> 42:33.680
Senior...

42:34.060 --> 42:35.560
Even on death's door,

42:35.870 --> 42:38.680
you're still dreaming of that?

42:40.310 --> 42:41.290
Please, help me!

42:43.060 --> 42:44.120
Fine.

42:55.950 --> 42:56.930
I felt a dark aura!

43:14.090 --> 43:19.410
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

43:20.650 --> 43:26.050
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

43:26.170 --> 43:29.370
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

43:29.610 --> 43:31.850
♪Old scenes rise again♪

43:32.250 --> 43:35.090
♪Too hard to forget♪

43:35.610 --> 43:39.570
♪Easier just to miss♪

43:40.410 --> 43:45.890
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

43:47.050 --> 43:52.330
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

43:52.930 --> 43:55.970
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

43:56.250 --> 43:58.370
♪Swept away by time♪

43:59.010 --> 44:01.650
♪Eyes once looked far♪

44:02.130 --> 44:06.090
♪Now lost in the shift♪

44:06.570 --> 44:09.410
♪Autumn winds stir♪

44:09.690 --> 44:11.610
♪Smoke curls once more♪

44:12.050 --> 44:14.490
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

44:14.810 --> 44:18.330
♪Returning to my eyes♪

44:18.890 --> 44:21.850
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

44:22.170 --> 44:25.090
♪Time lost its name♪

44:25.490 --> 44:28.330
♪Was it yesterday♪

44:28.730 --> 44:32.290
♪Or tomorrow?♪

44:32.650 --> 44:35.490
♪The world has changed♪

44:35.890 --> 44:37.730
♪Beyond recall♪

44:38.290 --> 44:40.010
♪Time will fade♪

44:40.410 --> 44:45.210
♪All the words ever spoken♪

44:45.890 --> 44:48.770
♪Only this longing remains♪

44:49.250 --> 44:54.530
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

44:55.650 --> 45:02.290
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

45:02.770 --> 45:12.490
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
